# The root and intermediate PRIVATE keys are only needed to rotate/regenerate the chain — which for a
# real release must be done with an offline root anyway. They are deliberately NOT committed. Only the
# first-party signing key (firstparty.key) is needed for ongoing dev builds, alongside the public
# records (intermediate.json/.sig, publisher.json/.sig) and the root public key (hexide-root.pub).
root.key
intermediate.key
